{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大夫", "id": "大夫"}, {"form": "左右", "id": "左右"}, {"form": "有司", "id": "有司"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "舍", "id": "舍"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "諸", "id": "諸"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.7137664677626809, "source": "左右", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.6108864526485625, "source": "左右", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.505525936990736, "source": "反", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 4.114963849424837, "source": "大夫", "target": "諸"}, {"weight": 2.323204380196781, "source": "大夫", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.2245920915286717, "source": "有司", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.793208009442517, "source": "有司", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 1.4069136483226263, "source": "有司", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.8960880245566357, "source": "王", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 1.1192315758708453, "source": "王", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 0.20294084399669038, "source": "王", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 1.1445493838551353, "source": "人", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 0.5314449109687264, "source": "人", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 0.8960880245566357, "source": "君", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 1.8123787564307907, "source": "君", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 0.7137664677626809, "source": "君", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.3015531326648, "source": "君", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 1.1445493838551353, "source": "國", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.6108864526485625, "source": "賢", "targ